{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A local co-op game where two players work together to fly a plane\u2014one as the pilot, the other as the navigator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is simple: fly to the correct destination. The pilot controls the plane while watching the screen, but doesn't have access to the map. On the other hand, the navigator can read the map, but cannot see the game screen. <strong>The two players must communicate using only words to complete their mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in a mysterious national park where terrain, airspace, and weather conditions change with every flight. Accurate communication and coordination are essential for navigating these changing conditions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790280?t=1752569828","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/5d364bf37d3794eda91071a78e7e74156d826eaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752569828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/fbd53d9e22fee135bd8a743c1bd93db3005d5961/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752569828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/fbd53d9e22fee135bd8a743c1bd93db3005d5961/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752569828","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A local co-op game where two players work together to fly a plane\u2014one as the pilot, the other as the navigator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is simple: fly to the correct destination. The pi